      "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_tengu_hornet_convo03_01.mp3",
      "text": "I was able to clean up Spanish Harlem without murdering everybody.",
      "duration": 4.283
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Vindicta",
      "audioFile": "hornet_match_start_tengu_hornet_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/hornet_match_start_tengu_hornet_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "Were you.",
      "duration": 0.963
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Ivy",
      "audioFile": "tengu_match_start_tengu_hornet_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/tengu_match_start_tengu_hornet_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "The Mendoza syndicate is gone.",
      "duration": 1.857
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Vindicta",
      "audioFile": "hornet_match_start_tengu_hornet_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/hornet_match_start_tengu_hornet_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "That you can see.  For now.  Ivy; some might mistake your naievty for charm but believe me when I say it is dangerous.  And if you don't smarten up soon someone you care about is going to be hurt.  Not everyone deserves redemption\u2026 and even fewer are capable of it.",
      "duration": 17.524
    }
  ]
